(control_print_gid_element_mpc [6.302] -no: the elements with an mpc'd
 [slave] node are not written; node 7 is the slave of mpc_node_number 0, so
 only element 1 remains [= Professional 02-08-2026].
 Model: three quad4 in a row [nodes 1-8], nodes 1 and 5 fixed, force on
 node 8, one time step.
 build_safe.sh runs it in a scratch copy and checks the .flavia files.)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
materi_stress
end_initia
node 1 0 0
node 2 1 0
node 3 2 0
node 4 3 0
node 5 0 1
node 6 1 1.3
node 7 2 0.8
node 8 3 1
element 1 -quad4 1 2 5 6
element 2 -quad4 2 3 6 7
element 3 -quad4 3 4 7 8
group_type 0 -materi
group_materi_elasti_young 0 1.e3
group_materi_elasti_poisson 0 0.2
group_materi_memory 0 -total_linear
bounda_dof 0 1 -velx -vely
bounda_dof 2 5 -velx -vely
bounda_time 2 0.
bounda_time 0 0.
bounda_force 1 8 -vely
bounda_time 1 1.
control_timestep 10 1. 1.
control_print_gid 10 -yes
mpc_node_number 0 7 -vely 6 -vely
control_print_gid_element_mpc 10 -no
end_data
